Bouncy Kings Terms and Conditions,What types of entertainment and inflatable hire packages do you offer?,"The company lists a wide range of products, including Action Packages, Bounce and Slide Packages, Bouncy Castle Packages, Event Entertainment Packages, Fun Food Packages, Inflatable Slide Packages, Rodeo Bull Packages, Soft Play Packages, Wedding Packages, and many themed entertainment options such as Animal, Balloon, Celebration, Christmas, Circus, Dinosaur, Disco, Farm Yard, Football, Funfair, Jungle, Party, Paw Patrol, Pirate, Princess, Superhero, and Wedding themed entertainment."
