Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,What is your cancellation policy if I need to cancel or change my booking?,"The provided text does not include any cancellation policy, cancellation fees, or change terms."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,"Do you charge a deposit, and if so how much is it?",The provided text does not mention any deposit amount or payment terms.
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,"What are your delivery and pickup times, and do you deliver in rainy weather?","The provided text does not include any delivery or pickup times, and it does not mention rain or weather-related delivery conditions."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,What are your standard delivery and collection times?,"Our standard delivery time is between 7am and 12 noon, and collection is between 4pm and 7pm."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,Can I request a specific delivery or collection time?,"We are unable to take specific timings unless hiring a venue. You can make a request and notes can be added to your booking, and we will do our best to accommodate it, but it cannot be guaranteed."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,Can delivery or connection times be changed after they are sent?,"No. Once the delivery and connection times have been sent, no alterations or changes can be made."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,How much access space is needed for larger inflatables or equipment delivery?,"Some larger inflatables require at least a 1m access point, and in some cases the delivery team may need to drive directly onto the site or installation point."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,Can I refuse collection of the equipment?,No. The client must not refuse the collection of the equipment for any reason.
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,What happens if the setup is delayed when the delivery team arrives?,"The delivery team needs to start setup straight away. Any delays may be charged at £10 for every ten minutes, or the delivery may be refused with no refund given."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,What should I do if there is a breakdown or fault during the event?,All breakdowns or faults must be reported to the company ASAP by phone. The equipment should not be used again unless the company advises that it is safe to do so.
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,"If the equipment develops a fault during my hire, what will you do and how quickly?","Where possible, the company will dispatch someone to inspect the fault, provide a replacement subject to availability, and aim to fix or replace the equipment within 2 hours of the fault being reported."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,"Who owns the equipment, and are the sizes and measurements exact?",All equipment remains the property of the company at all times. All sizes and measurements quoted are approximate and are to the best of the company's knowledge.
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,How far can you run the power cables before a generator is needed?,"We use 25m extension leads to connect the power and equipment. These can be doubled up to a maximum length of 50m; after that, a generator would be required."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,What clothing must users wear on the equipment?,"Appropriate clothing must be worn at all times. All users must wear socks and all exposed skin must be covered to avoid burns, injury, or friction burns."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,Can the inflatable be used in hot weather?,"During hot weather, inflatables and PVC can become extremely hot. If the inflatable becomes too hot, it must not be used until the temperature has cooled."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,What happens if the weather is bad on the day of my booking?,The company will still turn up to all bookings regardless of the weather. No reduction in charges will be offered because of adverse weather on the day.
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,"If the company cancels my order because of high winds, will I get a refund?","No. If the order is cancelled due to high winds, any money or deposit paid will not be refunded, but will be used as a credit note on a future booking."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,How long are written quotations valid for?,Written quotations are valid for 14 days.
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,What deposit is required when placing an order?,"All orders require at least a 25% deposit, and it must be paid at the time of booking. Any order without a deposit will be cancelled."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,Can I cancel my hire if I change my mind after booking a specific product or service for a specific date?,"No. BK Inflatables Limited does not accept cancellations for hiring specific products, goods or services on a specific date."
Bouncy Castle Hire LeicesterPackage,What if I have a problem during the event?,You must report it as soon as possible by phone so the company can try to put it right. Any claims made after the hire period will not be accepted.
