Terms & Conditions of Bouncy Castle Hire,"Are somersaults, smoking, or barbecue equipment allowed near the bouncy castle?",No. Somersaults on the inflatables are strictly forbidden. Smoking and the use of barbecue equipment near the bouncy castle are also not allowed.
