"Ha az adatkezelés korlátozás alá esik, a",When may personal data subject to restriction of processing be processed beyond storage?,"If processing is restricted, personal data may, apart from storage, only be processed with the data subject's consent, or for the establishment, exercise or defense of legal claims, or for the protection of the rights of another natural or legal person, or for important reasons of public interest of the Union or of a Member State."
